{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauChecker-9846": "JEROME: （线索已经不少，该找卡尔诺警佐谈谈。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauConclusion-9847": "CARNEAU: 好，让我都记下来……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauConclusion-9848": "CARNEAU: 医生，我虽然不是专业的，可也有妻子和三个孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauConclusion-9849": "CARNEAU: 麦克马斯特夫人说，伊芙琳恶心想吐。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauConclusion-9850": "CARNEAU: 朱莉娅说，失踪女子脸色发红、浮肿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauConclusion-9851": "CARNEAU: 马洛里夫人说，她很容易气喘。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauConclusion-9852": "CARNEAU: 安娜贝尔说，伊芙琳连在室内都用着复杂的幻形术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauConclusion-9853": "CARNEAU: 斯托克斯说，她梳洗打扮花很久，却从不让人帮忙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauConclusion-9854": "CARNEAU: 莉塞特还说，她总要去厕所。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauConclusion-9855": "CARNEAU: 不是医生，也知道这是什么情况。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauConclusion-9856": "JEROME: 伊芙琳·哈考特怀孕了，而且一直瞒着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauConclusion-9857": "JEROME: （凯瑟琳夫人绝不会对我说实话……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauConclusion-9858": "JEROME: （不过，斯托克斯和莉塞特在照顾伊芙琳时一定得到过额外的吩咐，也许能从这些安排中找出线索。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoireScene-9859": "THOMPSON: 啊，你在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoireScene-9860": "THOMPSON: 有什么发现？我看卡尔诺忙着整理笔记，忙得不可开交。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoireScene-9861": "JEROME: 有几件事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoireScene-9862": "JEROME: 首先，哈特小姐其实就是著名歌手伊芙琳·哈考特。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoireScene-9863": "JEROME: 其次，她住在这里，很可能因为她当时——或者现在——怀有身孕。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoireScene-9864": "JEROME: 第三，威格拉姆家的两个儿子都和她有过情事，但孩子未必属于他们任何一个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoireScene-9865": "JEROME: 事实上，我认为凯瑟琳夫人把她接来，是另有所图。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoireScene-9866": "JEROME: 夫人的谋划里，这间房尤其关键。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoireScene-9867": "THOMPSON: 我最烦牵扯这些乡间贵人的案子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoireScene-9868": "THOMPSON: 该我亲自去问问凯瑟琳夫人了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoireScene-9869": "THOMPSON: 看看房间里有没有我漏掉的东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoire-9870": "JEROME: 这衣柜上肯定有某种魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoire-9871": "CORDELIA: 乡间老宅有附魔家具，也不稀奇。不过我没察觉到魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoire-9872": "ALEXANDRA: 真的？明明就在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoire-9873": "ALEXANDRA: 嗯……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoire-9874": "ALEXANDRA: 是土系魔法，可很难抓住它。法术表面像覆了层滑溜溜的东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoire-9875": "CORDELIA: 难道这道法术设有密钥？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoire-9876": "CORDELIA: 试着和我一起接入。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoire-9877": "CORDELIA: 这里竟会有土系魔法，本身就很奇怪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-magicArmoire-9878": "CORDELIA: 不管怎样，已经解开了。要启动吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mazeChecker-9879": "KERAUNOS: 宅邸桥梁迷宫状态为 0。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mazeChecker-9880": "KERAUNOS: 宅邸桥梁迷宫状态为 1。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mazeChecker-9881": "KERAUNOS: 宅邸桥梁迷宫状态为 2。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mazeChecker-9882": "KERAUNOS: 威格拉姆迷宫 A 已开启。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mazeChecker-9883": "KERAUNOS: 威格拉姆迷宫 B 已开启。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mazeChecker-9884": "KERAUNOS: 设置迷宫变量？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mazeChecker-9885": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mazeChecker-9886": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredArrivalScene-9887": "JEROME: 我想，这已经不是同一座宅邸了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredMeeting-9888": "????: 你们是谁，为什么在我家？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredMeeting-9889": "JEROME: 我是杰罗姆·雷诺医生，您一定是凯瑟琳夫人的兄弟，阿尔弗雷德。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredMeeting-9890": "ALFRED: 怎么进来的？凯瑟琳呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredMeeting-9891": "JEROME: 据我所知，她不在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredMeeting-9892": "ALFRED: 别撒谎，不是她带着，你们不可能——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredMeeting-9893": "ALFRED: 啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredMeeting-9894": "ALFRED: 看来迟早会有这一天。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredMeeting-9895": "CORDELIA: 具体是什么意思？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredMeeting-9896": "ALEXANDRA: 这里是我的世界，对吧？没有魔法的那个世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredMeeting-9897": "ALFRED: 你们一定是首都大战中的那群人，以前就跨越过世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredMeeting-9898": "ALFRED: 可为什么到我家来？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredMeeting-9899": "JEROME: 我们是替警方来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9900": "伊芙琳怎么样了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9901": "ALFRED: 她发生过几次胎盘早剥，险些引发早产，此前我和同事还能治好，直到这最后一次。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9902": "ALFRED: 不过，很高兴告诉你，母婴平安。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9903": "昨晚你去过伊芙琳房间吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9904": "ALFRED: 是的，我去检查她的情况，当时显然只能接生了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9905": "衣柜里的传送门是怎么运作的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9906": "ALFRED: 说实话，我也不太明白它怎么运作，那是父亲造的，他向来有不少秘密，我只有解锁咒语。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9907": "你父亲杰赛亚在这里吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9908": "ALFRED: 不在，杰赛亚一直有病，正在外面疗养，我不确定他什么时候回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9909": "伊芙琳拿孩子来敲诈你？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9910": "ALFRED: 她确实威胁过我，不过血缘鉴定法术表明，孩子不是威格拉姆家的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9911": "那为什么还让她住在这里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9912": "ALFRED: 作为医生，我宣过誓，不伤害病人，不过照顾新生儿这种基本的事，也不需要靠誓言。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9913": "ALFRED: 总之，我渐渐同情起伊芙琳的处境，因为在首都为她治疗的同事，了解到了不少她的过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9914": "伊芙琳的过去？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9915": "ALFRED: 伊芙琳是孤儿，她学唱歌的舞台远没有那么……体面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9916": "ALFRED: 看完表演，那地方的客人会竞价买她的其他“服务”，她没有选择。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9917": "ALFRED: 能逃离那个世界简直是奇迹，可那些经历让她的私生活变得……混乱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9918": "ALFRED: 知道这些，我就不该苛责她了，眼下先让她住在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9919": "该知道的，应该都知道了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9920": "ALFRED: 我一会儿就去凯瑟琳家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9921": "ALFRED: 关于如何处理我们的“秘密”，看来得和她谈谈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredQuestions-9922": "ALFRED: 伊芙琳的事，我也会向警方解释清楚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-whiskersMeet-9923": "JEROME: 等等，那只猫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-whiskersMeet-9924": "<align=\"center\">还不来吗……“侦探”？</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9925": "????: 欢迎，我在四周施了隔音法术，阿尔弗雷德听不见我们说话。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9926": "????: 是我在说话，因为我没有发出人类语言的器官，只能靠魔法传声。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9927": "JEROME: 你是？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9928": "????: 尊贵的胡须爵士三世。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9929": "你就是我小时候读的诗里那只猫？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9930": "WHISKERS: 不，不是，他是我的天祖父……或者是更远的祖辈吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9931": "杰赛亚在哪里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9932": "WHISKERS: 在另一栋房子里，暂时还好，是他派我来找你们谈的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9933": "能见见杰赛亚吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9934": "WHISKERS: 现在不行，今天他不太清醒。不过，之后很乐意替你们引见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9935": "不过，你的主人是杰西库斯？杰赛亚·威格拉姆？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9936": "WHISKERS: 正是，不过说我“属于”谁，未免有点诽谤。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9937": "他为什么在城里散发寻猫传单？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9938": "WHISKERS: 哦，不是老头发的，是我，全靠魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9939": "为什么要用传单设这个局？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9940": "WHISKERS: 我需要一位仰慕杰赛亚的人来寻找我，因为他的家人不肯成全他最后的心愿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9941": "杰赛亚到底多大年纪？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9942": "WHISKERS: 我也不太确定，阿尔弗雷德六十一岁，而他出生时，杰赛亚至少已经八十岁了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9943": "WHISKERS: 漫长的一生里，他组建过好几个家庭。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9944": "他怎么能活那么久？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9945": "WHISKERS: 靠魔法，杰赛亚的父亲当然是莱奥尼亚人，不过母亲是里恩人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9946": "WHISKERS: 他天生就能同时使用土系魔法和水系魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9947": "JEROME: 即便在那个年代，也非常罕见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9948": "WHISKERS: 据说如此，不过他的力量，加上数不清的魔法实验，让他的寿命远超常人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9949": "WHISKERS: 不过，即便如此，也快走到尽头了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9950": "你是怎么学会说话的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9951": "WHISKERS: 世界分裂后，杰赛亚再也找不到能与他交流的人类土系法师，于是赋予了我的祖先智慧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9952": "WHISKERS: 我能用土系魔法振动墙壁和家具，借此说话。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9953": "世界分裂时，杰赛亚就已经在世了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9954": "WHISKERS: 是的，他说过分裂发生时，能感觉到那股撕裂。因为那件事……还有一个相关的原因……他曾短暂地陷入疯狂。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9955": "JEROME: 那首名诗就是那时写的，在精神病院里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9956": "WHISKERS: 正是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9957": "所以，找我们来做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9958": "WHISKERS: 杰赛亚已走到生命尽头，离开这个世界之前，他还有最后一个心愿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9959": "JEROME: 是什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9960": "WHISKERS: 他在古籍里读到过一种生物，月光蝶，只要带一只给他，他就能完成最后的法术，平静地离开这个世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9961": "WHISKERS: 杰赛亚说，月光蝶只会在望得见尼巴罗斯山的地方孵化。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9962": "WHISKERS: 记载中有座山村，每年夏天都会出现月光蝶，不过不在这个世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9963": "如果找到一只月光蝶呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9964": "WHISKERS: 主人活了很久很久，他独有的魔法遗产里，一定有你们用得上的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9965": "WHISKERS: 比如一件独一无二的神器？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9966": "应该就这些了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Whiskers-9967": "WHISKERS: 请快些，我不知道那可怜的老傻瓜还能撑多久。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonReturn-9968": "THOMPSON: 雷诺医生？你们跑哪儿去了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonReturn-9969": "JEROME: 说来……话长。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonReturn-9970": "JEROME: 不过有件事可以告诉您：哈考特小姐还活着。她刚生下了一个孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonReturn-9971": "JEROME: 阿尔弗雷德·威格拉姆医生很快就会带她过来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonReturn-9972": "THOMPSON: 这帮有钱的蠢货，就这么白白耽误了我们的工夫？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonReturn-9973": "JEROME: 也可以这么看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonReturn-9974": "JEROME: 我们很快回来，还有最后一个疑问要解开。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-evelynTerrace-9975": "JEROME: 在那儿，母亲和孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-evelynTerrace-9976": "JEROME: 看起来都还好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-ThompsonLater-9977": "THOMPSON: 可以追究他们浪费警力的责任……可我不想让女仆顶在前头受罚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-ThompsonLater-9978": "THOMPSON: 至少得好好训训凯瑟琳夫人和她兄弟。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-ThompsonLaterOfficer-9979": "OFFICER: 能让整个世界围着自己转，真舒服啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9980": "BEN: 有人看见什么了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9981": "JUNA: 还没有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9982": "JUNA: 后面那小村子挺不错，干草也好。你们以前都来过？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9983": "JEROME: 来过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9984": "CORDELIA: 当时可没心情欣赏田园风光。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9985": "ALEXANDRA: 反正还在等……我有个问题。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9986": "JEROME: 什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9987": "ALEXANDRA: 那个杰西还是什么的。他经历过世界分裂？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9988": "JEROME: 看来是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9989": "ALEXANDRA: 他当时以为发生了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9990": "ALEXANDRA: 既然聊到了，那其他人又以为发生了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9991": "ALEXANDRA: 我的世界里，魔法消失了，发生大饥荒，还有地震。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9992": "ALEXANDRA: 大家以为，全世界的人几乎都死了，只剩塞伦和附近的农场。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9993": "ALEXANDRA: 其他世界的人怎么想？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9994": "AGATA: 堤刻半岛也差不多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9995": "AGATA: 没受过训练的人突然获得了强大的魔力。风之圣祠刮来的风暴，也大得超乎自然。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9996": "AGATA: 北方的城市全部毁灭，多年里都无法离开半岛远行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9997": "AGATA: 就连说杰兰德语的部族，也以为其他人全都葬身于风暴了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9998": "NIKOLAI: 我们国家倒没那么大变化。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-9999": "NIKOLAI: 雷兹和卢斯基亚还在旁边，仍是威胁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-10000": "NIKOLAI: 或者说是目标，看你怎么想。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-10001": "JEROME: 那他们以为里恩和莱奥尼亚出了什么事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-10002": "NIKOLAI: 我没读过几年书，也不怎么用功。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-10003": "NIKOLAI: 步兵训练时，他们说科尔辛战争在西方更激烈，那些国家把自己毁了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-10004": "NIKOLAI: 拿来警告我们，说我们也可能落到那个下场。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-10005": "ALEXANDRA: 你们呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-10006": "CORDELIA: 学界曾为此争论不休。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-10007": "CORDELIA: 主流理论认为，魔法的无节制使用，导致火、土[oxfordComma /]和风的魔力储库不断积累“债务”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-10008": "CORDELIA: 某种类似“魔法塌陷”的现象，就这样摧毁了其余文明。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-10009": "CORDELIA: 这也是建造迪亚孔的部分原因，但后来几乎没有深入调查。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-10010": "BEN: 真的？没人想再弄清楚点？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-10011": "ALEXANDRA: 就像邻居去世。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-10012": "ALEXANDRA: 大家总问“怎么死的”，其实只是想确认，那种事不会发生在自己身上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-10013": "ALEXANDRA: 一觉得自己安全，就不怎么在乎了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-10014": "JUNA: 哦，看！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-10015": "JEROME: 应该正是我们要找的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-lunarButterflies-10016": "JEROME: 带回威格拉姆宅邸吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3510": "Title: 卡尔诺警佐",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3511": "Description: 与一楼的卡尔诺警佐交谈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3512": "Title: 富贵人家的死法",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3513": "Description: 向宅邸宾客打听线索。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3514": "Title: 再访卡尔诺警佐",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3515": "Description: 返回一楼，向卡尔诺警佐汇报。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3516": "Title: 又是管家",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3517": "Description: 再与斯托克斯和莉塞特交谈，了解更多情况。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3518": "Title: 找探长谈谈",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3519": "Description: 与二楼的汤普森交谈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3520": "Title: 衣柜？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3521": "Description: 检查伊芙琳的房间，寻找异常之处。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3522": "Title: 我们在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3523": "Description: 探索这座新的宅邸。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3524": "Title: 大惊小怪",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3525": "Description: 穿过魔法衣柜，返回凯瑟琳夫人的宅邸。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3526": "Title: 一只猫？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3527": "Description: 跟随神秘的猫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3528": "Title: 月光蝶",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3529": "Description: 在尼巴罗斯山附近，寻找月光蝶群聚的山村。胡须说，它不在科黛莉娅的世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3530": "Title: 返回宅邸",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3531": "Description: 返回威格拉姆宅邸。"
}
